{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37460","headline":"中秋夜玩月 · 唐彦谦","name":"中秋夜玩月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一夜高楼万景奇，碧天无际水无涯。\n只留皎月当层汉，并送浮云出四维。\n雾静不容玄豹隐，冰生惟恐夏虫疑。\n坐来离思忧将晓，争得嫦娥仔细知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}